[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24546.23, "timestamp": "06:49:06", "text": "等等，它是像超级留言还是像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24558.43, "timestamp": "06:49:18", "text": "什么？这是什么？呃，这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24573.708, "timestamp": "06:49:33", "text": "蒂法？是的，谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24575.99, "timestamp": "06:49:35", "text": "那。哦，对，我忘了你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24579.23, "timestamp": "06:49:39", "text": "字面上的超级留言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24582.468, "timestamp": "06:49:42", "text": "这。好的，再见。太酷了。由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24589.708, "timestamp": "06:49:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24594.5, "timestamp": "06:49:54", "text": "总之，那边那个东西是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24596.31, "timestamp": "06:49:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]